// Read an SBOM from disk. This expression evaluates to a Protobom document.
// You can use this construct to feed a document into functions that expect
// them.
//
// Note that load_sbom() reads from the host filesystem, so it is only
// available when the protobom library is loaded with the EnableIO option:
//
//   library.NewProtobom(library.WithEnableIO(true))
//
// The default runner options do not enable it.
//
// To store an SBOM document in a variable, use the native bind function of
// the CEL runtime:
//
// cel.bind(myvar, protobom.load_sbom("examples/curl.spdx.json"), myvar)
//
protobom.load_sbom("examples/curl.spdx.json")
